    {
      "name": "NpcHandle",
      "doc": "An NPC placed and moved through the \"npc\"/\"npc-remove\"/\"npc-die\" effects, as `createNpc` hands it back. Owns only where it stands and dispatching its own placement — a script's own bookkeeping (health, AI state, and the rest) stays the script's own. `model` is `undefined` for an NPC `createNpc` placed with no `model` option, left for the world to draw with its own default figure.",
      "members": [
        {
          "name": "model",
          "type": "M",
          "optional": false,
          "doc": ""
